                                                            <script>
                                                                const faqData = {
                                                                    general: [
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What is a game development company?",
                                                                            a: "A game development company designs, engineers, and ships interactive digital experiences across mobile, PC, console, and web platforms, covering everything from initial concept and art production through QA, launch, and post-launch live-operations management."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What types of games does Clarisco build?",
                                                                            a: "We build across all major categories: casual and hyper-casual mobile, mid-core and AAA co-development, real-money iGaming (casino, poker, crash, rummy), fantasy sports, Web3 and play-to-earn, metaverse, and HTML5 web games for global clients."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Do you offer full-cycle game development services?",
                                                                            a: "Yes. Our full-cycle game development services cover every stage: concept, GDD, art, engineering, QA, launch, and live-ops under a single accountable team with no vendor handoffs and no coordination gaps between disciplines."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Can Clarisco act as our outsourced game studio partner?",
                                                                            a: "Yes. We operate as outsourced game studio partners either by taking full ownership of a title or slotting into your existing team for specific disciplines such as art, engineering, QA, or porting, without disrupting the rest of your pipeline."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Do you work with startups as well as established publishers?",
                                                                            a: "We work with both. Startups get prototype-first engagements to validate gameplay before committing a full budget. Established publishers and studios needing AAA game production services or co-development capacity get scaled teams that match their production volume and milestone cadence."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Where can I find reliable AAA game co-development studios?",
                                                                            a: "Clarisco is one of the most trusted game co-development studios for publishers needing long-term embedded production partners with discipline leads who own deliverables, transparent weekly milestone reviews, and a clean track record of on-scope delivery."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What are the best B2B game development companies?",
                                                                            a: "The best B2B game development companies combine genre-agnostic expertise, transparent pricing, and a dedicated project lead who acts as a single point of accountability. Clarisco operates exclusively B2B and never publishes competing consumer titles under our own name."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Do you sign NDAs and transfer full IP ownership?",
                                                                            a: "Yes. We sign mutual NDAs before any detailed scope discussion begins. All source code, art assets, game design documents, and IP created during the engagement are transferred entirely to you, with no licensing retention or ongoing dependency on Clarisco."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],

                                                                    business: [
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What does your AAA co-development service include?",
                                                                            a: "As Unreal Engine 5 co-dev partners and game co-development studios, we provide embedded art, engineering, and QA teams that integrate directly into your pipeline, delivering AAA game production services at the scope and quality standard your publisher requires."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "Do you offer game porting services?",
                                                                            a: "Yes. Our game porting studios handle every major platform migration, including PC to console game porting across PlayStation, Xbox, and Nintendo Switch. We manage control scheme adaptation, certification requirements, performance optimization, and first-party submission end-to-end."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What does cross-platform optimization involve?",
